  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SolarGen Solar Powered Irrigation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Solar.Beneficiaries: .Description: SolarGen is a renewable energy company focused on Kenya&apos;s remote and conflict-affected northeastern region. Through the support of USADF and a debt investment from Nithio, SolarGen will open new offices in Wajir and Garissa. They will expand their current offering of solar-powered water pumping equipment via a sharia-compliant loan product. This will be highly impactful for farmers in the arid region.</narrative>
  </description>
